Author: Jian Qin [aut, cre], Chunbo Huang [aut], Shulan Sun [aut], Shaoqiang Wang [aut], Changhui Peng [aut]
Description: This photosynthesis model integrates solar-induced chlorophyll fluorescence (SIF) into leaf photosynthesis process to calculate the instantaneous leaf gross photosynthetic rate, and is an integrated model based on the TRIPLEX-CW-Flux model and the mechanistic light reaction (MLR) model.
